      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>The ongoing tax assessment (?) assigned as an iq\u1e6d\u0101\u02bf was not subject to the</li>\n<li>imposition of a canal official (muwa\u1e93\u1e93af al-jus\u016br), nor to any claim of d\u012bw\u0101n\u012b dues,</li>\n<li>for its inhabitants over a period of years. However, the officials</li>\n<li>have now begun to exact [payment] from them through the appointment of a canal official and tax collector (ghar\u012bm).</li>\n<li>The \u02beam\u012br orders that an inspection (kashf) be conducted concerning [this matter] &hellip;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
